sequenceDiagram
    participant JS as Main JS DOM
    participant W as Rust/WASM worker
    participant H as Native web host
    participant MC as MC runner
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GPU as GPU worker
    participant Model as Local adapter
    JS->>W: Typed send intent
    W->>H: Submit effect
    Note over H: Session / origin / CSRF
    H->>MC: Private typed dispatch
    Note over MC: Validate route and DTO
    Note over MC,DB: Reject before queue effects
    MC->>DB: Commit input + run + event
    MC-->>W: 202 via native host
    W-->>JS: Queued view
    Note over DB,GPU: Durable offline queue
    GPU->>DB: Listen, scan, choose model
    GPU->>Model: Load selected model
    GPU->>DB: Claim ready-model job
    DB-->>GPU: Input + token + lease
    GPU->>Model: Generate locally
    GPU->>DB: Renew current lease
    Note over DB,GPU: Every 10 seconds while running
    Model-->>GPU: Reply or failure
    GPU->>DB: Publish current attempt
    DB-->>MC: Result wake-up
    MC->>DB: Finalize transcript + event
    W->>H: Next event page
    H->>MC: Authorized read
    MC->>DB: Read saved result
    MC-->>W: Result via native host
    W-->>JS: Accepted reply view
